able to teach you the tinker crafting techniques, but requires input to do so (500 gold and a talent category point).","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"7c48a850c3da7fa40b1deaada967574a6ca9a3502969841fb221ba29c72e9390","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/chats/aaf.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a strange triangular device, some kind of automated facility.*#WHITE#\nIt seems to be able to teach you the tinker crafting techniques, but requires input to do so (500 gold and a talent category point).","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你面前有一个奇怪的三角形设备，似乎是某种自动设施。*#WHITE#\n\t似乎它能教授你制造配件的技巧，但需要你一些投入（500金币+一点大系点）。","target_preimage_sha256":"7c48a850c3da7fa40b1deaada967574a6ca9a3502969841fb221ba29c72e9390","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/manifest.json","observation_identity":"57014f2a3bced09e5ffd4168fcbdaa79634d02f7ca330a4c0c002a4e3a2e392a","publication_commit":"8c67c8fd4ee4157016869bab5e129169606ef659","result_sha256":"52a44c207cb78c4b69a04b46f9ac4bbc02d6737725b38def983027f5d2428f41","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"dc7acfb8db399099361d25a218c89f64cf6e09c4b228c3a0854cdd4bc01f35a1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"a668705856cd7297fb89aed03e5d5d647948c81d2efba4a280d9663d3ef6d0a6","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"30623d3cad529c9fc06bf7e4ce6c8477f1f0e4ff83eedb1e3e6004057e9ce6ec","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"dc7acfb8db399099361d25a218c89f64cf6e09c4b228c3a0854cdd4bc01f35a1","component":"orcs","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"30623d3cad529c9fc06bf7e4ce6c8477f1f0e4ff83eedb1e3e6004057e9ce6ec","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"a668705856cd7297fb89aed03e5d5d647948c81d2efba4a280d9663d3ef6d0a6","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/gem.lua","source":"\"...for posterity!  Let's make sure future generations can hear the moments of history being made!\" You hear the voice of Councillor Tantalos again... and then you hear a very strange voice, one that's all too clear. Even with the device playing it, it sounds like it's coming from inside your own head.#{normal}#\n\n\"Yes, yes, good idea. This is an important day, for both of us - no, for Eyal...  You've brought what I asked for so long ago, then?\"\n\n\"Of course!  It's just--  bring the cart around here!\"  (Clanking and grinding.)  \"Open it up, if you wish.\"\n\n\"No need.  I can feel its power, it's so familiar and yet so new...  This could only be the Eye of Amakthel Himself!  It's beautiful, and all will know its beauty...\"\n\n\"Er...  splendid, I assume!  This is the beginning of a long and beautiful partnership between the Atmos and...  your people!  Shall I go back up and tell them we're ready for them, and you're ready to handle the Orc situation? They're, ah, rather eager to come down here--\"\n\n\"GO FORTH, MY HERALD. TELL THEM ALL ARE WELCOME.\"\n\n\"Wh-what are you--\"  #{italic}#Screams in the background.  Gurgling.  Crashing.  A distant, bestial roar.#{normal}#\n\n\"AMAKTHEL WILL REWARD YOU FOR YOUR SERVICE AS YOU DESERVE.\" More crashing.  \"YOU SHALL BE BLESSED WITH A BETTER NEW FORM.  A BETTER NEW MIND.  ALL YOUR PEOPLE ARE WELCOME TO...\"\n\n#{italic}#(You hear Parmor's voice again.)#{normal}#  \"Slag it, RUN!  Grab everything and--\"  (The recording ends.)\n","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"0ae92e02c3d03a4b99d55f5e97eb152f40f23ca9916f4c48d295752d335ec639","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/gem.lua","source":"\"...for posterity!  Let's make sure future generations can hear the moments of history being made!\" You hear the voice of Councillor Tantalos again... and then you hear a very strange voice, one that's all too clear. Even with the device playing it, it sounds like it's coming from inside your own head.#{normal}#\n\n\"Yes, yes, good idea. This is an important day, for both of us - no, for Eyal...  You've brought what I asked for so long ago, then?\"\n\n\"Of course!  It's just--  bring the cart around here!\"  (Clanking and grinding.)  \"Open it up, if you wish.\"\n\n\"No need.  I can feel its power, it's so familiar and yet so new...  This could only be the Eye of Amakthel Himself!  It's beautiful, and all will know its beauty...\"\n\n\"Er...  splendid, I assume!  This is the beginning of a long and beautiful partnership between the Atmos and...  your people!  Shall I go back up and tell them we're ready for them, and you're ready to handle the Orc situation? They're, ah, rather eager to come down here--\"\n\n\"GO FORTH, MY HERALD. TELL THEM ALL ARE WELCOME.\"\n\n\"Wh-what are you--\"  #{italic}#Screams in the background.  Gurgling.  Crashing.  A distant, bestial roar.#{normal}#\n\n\"AMAKTHEL WILL REWARD YOU FOR YOUR SERVICE AS YOU DESERVE.\" More crashing.  \"YOU SHALL BE BLESSED WITH A BETTER NEW FORM.  A BETTER NEW MIND.  ALL YOUR PEOPLE ARE WELCOME TO...\"\n\n#{italic}#(You hear Parmor's voice again.)#{normal}#  \"Slag it, RUN!  Grab everything and--\"  (The recording ends.)\n","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"“……为了繁荣！让我们用声音记录下，这个值得被子孙后代铭记的，改变历史的时刻！”你又听到了坦塔洛斯议员的声音……但你还听到了另一个奇怪的声音，一个清晰的声音。尽管是机器在播放着声音，但这段声音就像是从你的脑海里传来的一样。#{normal}#\n\n“是的，是的，这是一个好主意。这将会是一个重要的日子，对我们——不，对整个埃亚尔都值得铭记……那么，你今天把我一直以来都要的东西带来了？”\n\n“当然了！它就在——来啊，把车推上来！”（叮叮当当的声音）“如果您乐意的话，请你亲自打开看一下。”\n\n“不用了。我能感受到它的力量，多么熟悉而又新鲜的力量……这只能是阿马克泰尔本人的眼睛！它是多么的令人沉醉啊，很快，所有人都会感受到它的美丽…”\n\n“呃……太棒了，我保证！这将会是气之部族和……你的人民之间漫长而友好的友谊的开始！我这就回去告诉他们，我们已经准备好了，并且你也准备好处理兽人问题了，对吧？他们，啊，一定会很愿意亲自来这里——”\n\n“去吧。我的传令官。告诉他们，我十分欢迎你们。”\n\n“你，你在——” #{italic}#传来一声声尖叫。血液流淌之声。猛烈的撞击声。然后是一阵遥远的，野兽般的咆哮。#{normal}#\n\n“这是阿马克泰尔在亲自奖励你对他的服侍，是你所应得的荣耀。”更多的撞击声。“这是神给你的祝福。一具更美好的全新的身躯。一个更美好的全新心智。你的人民都可以得到这份…”\n\n#{italic}#（你听到了帕默的声音。）#{normal}#  “操，大家快跑！带上所有东西，快——”（纪录终止了）\n","target_preimage_sha256":"0ae92e02c3d03a4b99d55f5e97eb152f40f23ca9916f4c48d295752d335ec639","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/manifest.json","observation_identity":"b43778e560ea99e1a4e0fb7d42c0d3b35fcf74483ac56f5f69aa4cef98d03611","publication_commit":"8c67c8fd4ee4157016869bab5e129169606ef659","result_sha256":"d2c9c020c464250774d1625a38f8b066a7c34eb4f6d66eadfa02e1a692e4ee39","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-039763ae7e35cbc42c5e/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"85c412eb30a730f97e160a86b552c02507493f558827363f110e2b497a90c6be","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"a79480d625d3593293180ae270d12e20e6ccd11ce1e4b1573b3b9ce5081882b8","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"1ef53098302e720ac078e5152e320ede23ecbc1f259839cd5a233cb9a56c7591","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"85c412eb30a730f97e160a86b5